'''Drunken Foundry''' (酩酊製鉄所, ''Meitei Seitetsusho'', '''Drunken Ironworks''') is the 22nd sub-chapter of [[Uncanny Legends]], and the 71st sub-chapter overall. It was added in [[Version 9.3 Update|Version 9.3]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
An overall average chapter in terms of difficulty, [[Smokestack to Heaven|the last stage]] in particular may be difficult for some players.
{{LegendDiff|130|170|100}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces one new enemy:
*[[Gobble]]: A close-ranged [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy with long-reaching Area Attacks. Possesses the ability to do [[Toxic]] attacks, dealing 35% of [[Cat Units]]' maximum health as damage with each hit.

